<title>NORWAY: Norway CPI, GDP forecasts unchanged in '97 budget.</title>
<headline>Norway CPI, GDP forecasts unchanged in '97 budget.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Finance Ministry on Friday unveiled its revised draft budget for 1997 and left its forecasts for inflation and overall gross domestic product (GDP) unchanged.</p>
<p>The ministry forecast the consumer price index (CPI) at 2.5 percent in 1997. The 1996 CPI projection also was unchanged from the original draft in October at 1.25 percent.</p>
</text>
